<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W Q2 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W Q2 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.41 vs	1.43</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.59 vs	1.68</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.77 vs	1.14</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 63.33 vs     22.10</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  60.09 vs     19.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.02 vs	0.01 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.82 vs	0.53</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.27 vs	0.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.07 vs	0.05</p>
<p>    investment				 2.89 vs	1.19</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.62 vs	2.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.99 vs	2.93</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.24 vs	2.00</p>
<p>    net sales				109.40 vs     40.94</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 103.50 vs     36.19</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.07 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.75 vs	0.92</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.59 vs	0.60</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.14 vs	0.14</p>
<p>    investment				 5.03 vs	2.22</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom 48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
